# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Security Scanner Ignore List (.trivyignore)
# Databricks Identity Management & S3 Remote State Backend
# ==============================================================================
# This file defines approved exceptions for Trivy security checks in this
# repository, documenting the code ID, description, affected resources,
# and architectural justification for each exemption.
#
# Currently, all provisioned resources (KMS customer-managed keys with rotation,
# S3 state bucket with SSE-KMS, versioning, ownership controls, public access
# block, and Databricks account identities) comply with Trivy security standards.
#
# Add new exemption entries below following this format if needed:
#
# Rule ID:     <AVD-AWS-XXXX>
# Description: <Brief description>
# Severity:    <HIGH | CRITICAL>
# Target:      <file path and resource name>
# Justification:
#   1. <Detailed justification explaining why this check is exempted>
# <AVD-AWS-XXXX>
# ==============================================================================

# Rule ID:     AVD-AWS-0104
# Description: Security group rule allows unrestricted egress to any IP address.
# Severity:    CRITICAL
# Target:      modules/01.networking/006.databricks_mws_networking/main.tf (aws_security_group.privatelink_vpce_sg)
# Justification:
#   1. Databricks PrivateLink interface VPC endpoint security group outbound traffic rule.
